OK  escaped star literal (lit): got=True exp=True
OK  ? single char: got=True exp=True
OK  contains|all: got=False exp=False
OK  not missing field: got=True exp=True
OK  null value = missing: got=True exp=True
OK  1 of sel*: got=True exp=True
OK  re case-sensitive: got=False exp=False
OK  uri-query vs encoded: got=True exp=True
OK  uri-query double enc: got=True exp=True
OK  plus as space: got=True exp=True
OK  numeric gt on status: got=False exp=False
OK  keyword search body: got=True exp=True
